# Copy to .env (never commit .env).
# NOTE: .env is not auto-loaded - export these in your shell or set them as CI secrets.
#
# The default provider is local Ollama (ADR-015): no key needed, no cost.
# Only set ANTHROPIC_API_KEY to compare against a hosted model; it bills separately
# from a Claude Pro subscription.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
#
# Optional overrides (see src/config.ts for the full list)
# SPR_LLM_PROVIDER=ollama
# SPR_LLM_MODEL=mistral-small3.2:latest
# SPR_LLM_BASE_URL=http://localhost:11434
# SPR_KOKORO_URL=http://localhost:8880
# SPR_TTS_VOICE=af_heart
#
# The LLM and TTS response cache is shared across runs, so re-running a stage is free.
# SPR_CACHE_DIR=.cache/spr
# SPR_CACHE_ENABLED=true
